			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4727498">
									

<p>So, all of y'all who are saying it is incoherent or difficult to understand&#8230;. there's largely a reason for that. This was actually NOT written by only me. In fact, I <strong>only</strong> wrote the Containment Procedures. From there, it was written as an Exquisite Corpse by all the authors mentioned in the original credits.</p>
<p>We wanted to initially post it to see how the reaction would be without this knowledge and it was&#8230; not too far from what we expected :p</p>
<p>It was fun to see, though!</p>
<p>If you guys have any theories as to an internal story or coherent logic to the whole thing, stick with it! Maybe there is! I hope the knowledge of this doesn't ruin the article for anyone.</p>
<p>Thanks guys!</p>
<p>PS. We started writing this back in mid January so the Exquisite Corpse contest totally stole our secret idea from us! <em>/s</em></p>

